  "longBusinessSummary": "DF Deutsche Forfait AG, provides foreign trade finance and related services for exporters, importers, and other financial companies in Iran, Europe, Germany, and the Czech Republic. It operates through three segments: Trade Finance, Food and Beverage, and Health and Pharma. The company offers agenting, consulting, and services for payments, marketing compliance services, debt collection and payment services, and factoring and forfaiting services. It also involved in the production and distribution of food and beverages in the hospitality sector; installation, management, and operation of bars and restaurants; and beer production and distribution, as well as the production and marketing of non-alcoholic beverages. In addition, the company engages in activities related to healthcare/medical and pharmaceutical industries; plasma production and processing; and logistics and distribution. Additionally, it is involved in the collection of foreign trade receivables; project financing; and purchase commitments activities. DF Deutsche Forfait AG was founded in 2000 and is headquartered in Cologne, Germany.",
